      "title": "Spring Initializr and the Boot Mental Model",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 0,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Spring Initializr and the Boot Mental Model",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. What Boot Is",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==Boot== = Spring + **auto-configuration** + **starters** + embedded server",
                "Beans are configured from the ==classpath==: almost no XML or boilerplate",
                "==Initializr== generates a zipped skeleton: build file, main class, test class",
                "Also in the zip: `application.properties`, wrapper scripts",
                "Reach it at start.spring.io, an IDE wizard, or `curl`"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Initializr Choices",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Choice",
                "Options"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Project type",
                  "Maven or Gradle"
                ],
                [
                  "Language",
                  "Java, Kotlin, Groovy"
                ],
                [
                  "Boot version",
                  "pick a stable release"
                ],
                [
                  "Group / artifact",
                  "project coordinates"
                ],
                [
                  "Packaging",
                  "==jar== or war"
                ],
                [
                  "Java version",
                  "e.g. 21"
                ],
                [
                  "Dependencies",
                  "starters like `web`, `data-jpa`"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "The same choices work from the command line via `-d` flags"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "bash",
              "lines": [
                "curl https://start.spring.io/starter.zip \\",
                "  -d dependencies=web,data-jpa \\",
                "  -d type=maven-project \\",
                "  -d javaVersion=21 \\",
                "  -o demo.zip"
              ],
              "note": "downloads demo.zip, a ready Maven project"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Convention over Configuration",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Default",
                "Value"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Port",
                  "==8080=="
                ],
                [
                  "Server",
                  "embedded **Tomcat**"
                ],
                [
                  "Config file",
                  "`application.properties`"
                ]
              ],
              "frame": "dashed"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Override only when needed",
              "text": "Boot ships sensible defaults. Change a setting only when the default does not fit."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
