    {
      "title": "Parent POM, Dependency Management and Starters",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 2,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Parent POM, Dependency Management and Starters",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. The parent POM and the BOM",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`spring-boot-starter-parent` as `<parent>` gives a ==BOM== of tested versions",
                "Also sets plugin config, Java version, ==UTF-8==, resource filtering",
                "Declare managed deps with **no** `<version>`",
                "Override: property `<spring-data-bom.version>` or explicit `<version>`"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "xml",
              "lines": [
                "<parent>",
                "  <artifactId>spring-boot-starter-parent</artifactId>",
                "</parent>",
                "<dependency>",
                "  <artifactId>spring-boot-starter-web</artifactId>",
                "</dependency>"
              ],
              "note": "no version on the dependency"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. No parent allowed? Import the BOM",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Company parent POM: ==import== `spring-boot-dependencies` in `<dependencyManagement>`",
                "Gradle: the `io.spring.dependency-management` plugin"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "xml",
              "lines": [
                "<dependencyManagement><dependencies>",
                "  <dependency>",
                "    <artifactId>spring-boot-dependencies</artifactId>",
                "    <type>pom</type>",
                "    <scope>import</scope>",
                "  </dependency>",
                "</dependencies></dependencyManagement>"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Starters",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==Starter== = one curated dependency pulling a set of transitive libs"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Starter",
                "Brings"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "`-web`",
                  "MVC + Tomcat + Jackson"
                ],
                [
                  "`-data-jpa`",
                  "JPA + Hibernate + Spring Data"
                ],
                [
                  "`-test`",
                  "JUnit, Mockito, Spring test"
                ],
                [
                  "`-security`",
                  "Spring Security"
                ],
                [
                  "`-validation`",
                  "Bean Validation"
                ],
                [
                  "`-actuator`",
                  "health and metrics"
                ]
              ],
              "frame": "dashed"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Common mistakes",
              "text": "Pinning explicit versions of managed libs causes a **mismatch** with the Boot BOM. Do not add a starter for every library: only what you need."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Project Layout, Main Class and @SpringBootApplication",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 3,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Project Layout, Main Class and @SpringBootApplication",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Standard Layout",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Path",
                "Holds"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "`src/main/java`",
                  "application code"
                ],
                [
                  "`src/main/resources`",
                  "`application.properties` or `.yml`, `static/`, `templates/`"
                ],
                [
                  "`src/test/java`",
                  "tests"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. The Main Class",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`SpringApplication.run` creates the ==ApplicationContext==",
                "Then runs ==auto-configuration==",
                "Then starts the **embedded server**"
              ],
              "style": "number"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "java",
              "lines": [
                "package com.example.demo;",
                "@SpringBootApplication",
                "public class DemoApplication {",
                "  public static void main(String[] args) {",
                "    SpringApplication.run(DemoApplication.class, args);",
                "  }",
                "}"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. @SpringBootApplication",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`@SpringBootConfiguration`: this is a config class",
                "`@EnableAutoConfiguration`: beans from the classpath",
                "`@ComponentScan`: finds your components",
                "Scan starts at the main class's package, ==sub-packages only==",
                "Keep the main class in the root package, e.g. `com.example.demo`"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Sibling or parent package",
              "text": "A bean or controller outside the root package is never found: 404s or `NoSuchBeanDefinitionException`. Move it under the root, or set `scanBasePackages`."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
